<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>治上焦痰 - 标签 | 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E6%B2%BB%E4%B8%8A%E7%84%A6%E7%97%B0/</link><description>这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。</description><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-alpha-mtcmp1fx</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</webMaster><copyright>本站内容采用 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 国际许可协议。</copyright><lastBuildDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 18:15:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E6%B2%BB%E4%B8%8A%E7%84%A6%E7%97%B0/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>饱治法：论治上焦火 论治上焦痰 论治胃寒 论治脾寒 论治痨虫 论消肺痰</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-38-ezhifa/</link><pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 18:10:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (Acuherb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-38-ezhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%89%E5%B0%84%E9%9B%86/">卷三射集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“饱治法”部分，专论借助&lt;strong&gt;饱食或饱餐药膳&lt;/strong&gt;以治疗上焦头目病、痰壅欲吐、胃寒脾寒、痨虫、顽痰等症的独特治法。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;病在上焦宜饱饭后服药，使药力留于上焦；欲吐者饱食后服吐药，借食气助涌吐而不伤胃；脏腑虚寒者以药膳饱餐，使药力久留专补一经&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>